    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>A hail damage claim supplement adds missed items, hidden damage, and corrected pricing to an existing claim estimate.</li>
<li>Commonly missed items include starter, ridge cap, drip edge, flashing, vents, detach-and-reset work, and debris removal.</li>
<li>In Corpus Christi, a re-roof needs a city permit, and the submission includes a TDI WPI-1 form from a windstorm engineer or inspector.</li>
